NOTE (v0.1 scaffold): this is a clean-room Rust re-implementation of the
*concepts* (segmented downloading, chunks, speed limiting, queue,
categories) inspired by XDM (https://github.com/subhra74/xdm, GPL-2.0).
No XDM source code is copied into this repository. As a derivative work
in spirit, this project is licensed GPL-2.0 to stay compatible.
When creating the GitHub repo, create it EMPTY (no template README or
license) and let this file be the license declaration until the full
GPL-2.0 text is added.
